        {
          "type": "story",
          "title": {
            "en": "From cow dung to cooking gas",
            "as": "গোবৰৰ পৰা ৰন্ধন গেছ"
          },
          "text": [
            {
              "en": "In a sealed tank, microbes turn dung into <mark>biogas</mark>, mostly methane. What remains is a good fertiliser.",
